<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεγμᾰτώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>full of phlegm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεφαλαί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
				</span></i>
			<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of food,
				<i>nourishing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Loc.Hom.</u>
				41
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>inflammatory,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				406a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of persons,
				<i>phlegmatic,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				3.14
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				860b9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>like phlegm,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάθαρσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HA</u>
					574b5
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				578b19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ αἷμα . . ῥέει -έστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Hom.</u>
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>apt to produce phlegm,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδατα</span>
				Id.<i>Aër</i><i><span class="en">
				7
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
